# Single source of truth for the baked TypeScript toolchain versions, shared by the
# docker provider image (docker/Dockerfile) and the e2b template (e2b/e2b.Dockerfile)
# so the two providers offer the SAME toolchain and cannot drift.
#
# Both Dockerfiles hardcode these versions (so `docker build` and `e2b template
# build` need no special flags); the internal/toolchain test fails if either
# Dockerfile no longer matches this file. To bump a version: edit it here AND in both
# Dockerfiles — the test will tell you if you miss one.
#
# Format: name=version (one per line; # comments allowed).
typescript=5.6.3
tsx=4.19.2
eslint=9.13.0
